00:01:36,704 --> 00:01:38,204
I'm Gigi Murin.

3
00:01:38,204 --> 00:01:41,524
I used to be 14 years old in eighth grade, but now I'm not.

4
00:01:42,064 --> 00:01:45,184
I'm a bit clumsy, crazy and silly,

5
00:01:45,184 --> 00:01:48,884
and I may not look it, but actually, I'm a member of Hololive English Justice.

6
00:01:48,884 --> 00:01:49,804
That's true.

7
00:01:51,524 --> 00:01:53,304
Every day is just the same old thing,

8
00:01:53,304 --> 00:01:55,324
people always look at my face and they're like, "What is that?"

9
00:01:55,324 --> 00:01:58,044
And my big, big hieroglyph is a mystery. I don't really know why.

10
00:02:06,182 --> 00:02:09,502
Lately called the "fister", 'cause I fister people, you know? You know what I mean?

11
00:02:11,772 --> 00:02:16,892
Today is the day of a very important Justice meeting, but I absolutely overslept.

12
00:02:16,892 --> 00:02:21,072
So I have to hurry up and make sure to look both ways before crossing the road.

13
00:02:21,072 --> 00:02:24,302
And... go!

14
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,500
